1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
Who approved the ad firm whose ads
delivered spyware?

2
00:00:07,029 --> 00:00:12,507
15 Oct, researchers: its ads delivered
spyware on display. No click needed.

3
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:18,936
At least 45 devices at one newsroom were
targeted.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:25,364
It sat on the ad industry's global vendor
list for six years.

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:31,943
Approved vendor. Until October.
